{"id":"77d9af1e2dba8486","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-disjoint-coproducts.md","title":"Definition — 余积不交","display":"Definition — 余积不交","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-disjoint-coproducts","aliases":["14-df-disjoint-coproducts"],"display":"Definition — 余积不交","depends_on":["[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-disjoint-coproducts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-disjoint-coproducts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 余积不交"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为有拉回的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为对象族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为候选对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_i:A_i\\to Q\">\\(\\iota_i:A_i\\to Q\\)</span> 为候选箭头族。余积普遍性质在下式直接展开，不把对象族当作已编码的函子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\times_QA_j\">\\(A_i\\times_QA_j\\)</span> 取对应拉回对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>初对象谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>，不重复定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\leftrightarrow\\bigl[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i,X)\\ \\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\ \\forall i\\in I\\ (u\\circ\\iota_i=f_i)\\bigr]\\land\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(\\iota_i)\\land\\bigl[\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsInitial}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i\\times_QA_j))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\leftrightarrow\\bigl[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i,X)\\ \\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\ \\forall i\\in I\\ (u\\circ\\iota_i=f_i)\\bigr]\\land\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(\\iota_i)\\land\\bigl[\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsInitial}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i\\times_QA_j))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Appendix 的 Giraud 条件。不交是交叉拉回为初对象；旧<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a>错写所有 Hom(X,P) 单元素，实为终对象。Set 中两个不交单点的拉回是空集，给出直接反证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"初对象谓词采用 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]，不重复定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Appendix 的 Giraud 条件。不交是交叉拉回为初对象；旧[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]错写所有 Hom(X,P) 单元素，实为终对象。Set 中两个不交单点的拉回是空集，给出直接反证。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_i:A_i\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"A_i\\times_QA_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsDisjointCoproduct}(Q,(\\iota_i)_{i\\in I})\\leftrightarrow\\bigl[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i,X)\\ \\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\ \\forall i\\in I\\ (u\\circ\\iota_i=f_i)\\bigr]\\land\\forall i\\in I\\ \\operatorname{IsMono}(\\iota_i)\\land\\bigl[\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (i\\ne j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{IsInitial}_{\\mathcal C}(A_i\\times_QA_j))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1483,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-disjoint-coproducts|Definition — 余积不交]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]]"},{"id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的固定宇宙，所有小指标均指 $\\mathcal U$-小。$\\mathcal E$ 是候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsLocallySmall}$、有限极限、极限与余极限分别见 [[14-df-category]]、[[14-df-elementary-topos]]、[[14-df-limits-colimits]]。拉回见 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]，不交余积见 [[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]]。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-disjoint-coproducts|Definition — 余积不交]]"},{"id":"fc84ef09de6f7fd1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$1$ 是指定终对象，$!_U:U\\to1$ 是唯一箭头；$U$ 为次终对象指该箭头为单态射。余积采用 [[14-df-disjoint-coproducts]] 的普遍性质，不预先选取未定义的余积对象记号。"}],"outgoing":["8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","1044b7940aaa4f1f","199dc3cf97e92fa1","2e748a8b3caef6a6"]}